Everything in this directory is licensed under the Pulse Client License 1.0
(full text: ../LICENSE-CLIENT.md).

Until 2026-08-27 this file carved out one exception: `streaming/patches/`,
GPL-3.0-or-later, patches against gpu-screen-recorder. That directory, the
recorder it patched and the Python bridge that drove them were the older Linux
capture path; all three have been removed in favour of the Rust sidecar in
`linux-hq-sidecar/`. There is no exception left — and with it, no GPL-licensed
source anywhere in this repository.

